OL,4,CGuinea-Bissau's military leaders delay 
OL,5,Creturn to civilian rule until 2028     
OL,6,GGuinea-Bissau's military rulers have   
OL,7,Gpostponed elections scheduled for next 
OL,8,Gweek by two years, delaying the return 
OL,9,Gto civilian rule.                      
OL,11,FTransitional President Gen Horta N'Tam 
OL,12,Fannounced in a decree that the         
OL,13,Fpresidential and parliamentary         
OL,14,Felections, originally due on 6         
OL,15,FDecember, would now take place on 26   
OL,16,FNovember 2028.                         
OL,18,FThe announcement came exactly a year   
OL,19,Fafter the military seized power,       
OL,20,Fpromising to return the country to     
OL,21,Fcivilian rule within 12 months.        
